      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_03_01",
      "hash64": "E86C66DB19AABCDF",
      "text": "상대는 전학생인가!\\n더할 나위 없는 상대인걸![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_03_02",
      "hash64": "E86C67DB19AABE92",
      "text": "분하지만 나의 패배야!\\n다음 승부도 건투를 빌게![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sub_012_chara_04_01",
      "hash64": "1A117704D2E3CAC4",
      "text": "어머, [VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1900(0006)]구나.\\n살살 부탁할게.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
